B ? (chance)","explanation":"happen \u002B to-infinitive = do something by chance: happen to know."},{"answer":"going","accept":["to go"],"options":["to go","going","go","to going"],"base":null,"keyword":null,"lead":null,"sentence":"Don\u0027t bother ___ \u2014 the shop\u0027s shut.","hint":"bother \u002B both, -ing common","explanation":"bother \u002B -ing (or to-infinitive): don\u0027t bother going. Both accepted."}]}